🚀 Getting Started
1. Prerequisites
Python 3.11+

Ollama installed and running on your local system with llama3:

Bash
ollama pull llama3
2. Installation
Clone the Repository:

Bash
git clone [https://github.com/1324Sa/ai-software-architect.git](https://github.com/1324Sa/ai-software-architect.git)
cd ai-software-architect
Create and Activate a Virtual Environment:

Windows (PowerShell):

PowerShell
python -m venv venv
Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope Process -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned
.\venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
Linux / macOS:

Bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
Install Dependencies:

Bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
